  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The initial concentrations of A, B, C, and D are 4M, 4M, 0M, and 0M respectively.</p><p>The equilibrium concentrations of A,B,C and D are&nbsp;4&minus;2=2M,&nbsp;4&minus;2=2M, 2M and 2M respectively.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8652;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi>initial</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>conc</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi>at</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>equilibrium</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>The expression for the equilibrium constant is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>&#8203;</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mfenced><mi>eq</mi></mfenced></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>"
  }
